WEBVTT - Podcast Episode 42: SaaS Retention Strategies

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
<v Host>Welcome back to The Growth Blueprint. Today we are breaking down why SaaS companies fail their pricing transitions.</v>

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.100
<v Host>Most founders think pricing is about matching competitors, but it is really about aligning your value metric with customer success.</v>

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
<v Host>If you charge per seat when your product creates value through automated background tasks, you disincentivize team adoption.</v>

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.300
<v Host>In our portfolio, switching from seat-based tiers to usage-correlated pricing increased net revenue retention from 104% to 138%.</v>
